    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41676" root="وجح" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَحَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَوْجَحُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْحٌ</span>, <i>He had
recourse,</i> or <i>betook himself,</i> to a thing or place,
<i>for protection</i> or <i>concealment.</i> (L.) [As also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَحِجَ</span>.] See 4.

